# a format 20 project, from before the arp's dotted speeds and the delay's triplet times (format 21): saved by that
# build, for the migration's test (tests/scenarios/migrate.xy). Track 1 an arp at 1/16 (4 then) with a lock of 1/4T
# (1 then) on step 1, track 2 an arp at 1/64 (8), FX I's delay at 1/8D (time 85), FX II's knobs left (the reverb).
# Run by a format 20 build (ffc0cd1): its loom_host tests/fixtures/make_v20.xy OUT
wait 300
bpm 102
param 1 player 1
param 1 p1 4
param 2 player 1
param 2 p1 8
param 11 e1 85
lock 1 1 1 p1 1
wait 40
projsave 1 v20_test
storesave tests/fixtures/store_v20.bin
